/T (We are extremely appreciative of the support our sponsors give us year after year. Without it, none of our achievements would be possible. The Cornell University section of the Society of Women Engineers values the strong relationships we have with our partners and seeks to cultivate long-lasting bonds with such organizations. We invite you to join in our mission of developing and sustaining a community for women engineers from all walks of life to reach their full potential. With your help, we will be able to continue to advocate for women in engineering for many years to come.)
